  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">mproving food security and resilient livelihoods in crisis-affected regions/states of Myanmar with humanitarian development peace nexus and conflict sensitive approach (FAO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved community social cohesion to strengthen resilience and build peace, 16 600 most vulnerable farming households (91 300 individuals) improve access to diversified nutritious and adequate food through cereal and vegetable production, Livelihoods of vulnerable farming households and their communities protected from shocks through scaled-up anticipatory actions and multipurpose cash transfer support</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To restore, protect and improve food security and resilience to shocks of conflict-affected communities in Myanmar through Humanitarian-Development and Peace nexus and conflict sensitive approachRCI(Resilience Index, &#xD68C;&#xBCF5;&#xB825;&#xC9C0;&#xC218;) &#xBCC0;&#xD654;&#xC728; &#xAE30;&#xCD08;&#xC120; &#xB300;&#xBE44; 6%p &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;, FIES(Food Insecurity Experience Scale, &#xC2DD;&#xB7C9;&#xC548;&#xBCF4;&#xCC99;&#xB3C4;) &#xAC10;&#xC18C;&#xC728; &#xAE30;&#xCD08;&#xC120; &#xB300;&#xBE44; 7%p &#xACBD;&#xAC10;</narrative>
  </description>
